{"server":"tw","storyId":"main_10_level_main_10-14_end","groupId":"main_10","stageId":"main_10-14","title":"血刃高懸","storyCode":"10-16","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_10-14_end.txt","sourceHash":"47776337e53f0d341e40bd3c2910d07988fd1dea1c3a547dea461ad6d26d4594","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"留下幫助自救軍撤退的推進之王，與克洛維希婭等人一起遭到了薩卡茲血魔大君的追擊。","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"11-end"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g5_giantwall_indoor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_408_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還要......還要繼續加快裝填頻率？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_408_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們真的想徹底毀了城內的移動地塊嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你對將軍的命令有疑問？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_408_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......我只是擔心這樣規模的轟炸會對城牆有影響......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_408_1","isRemote":false,"text":"過去從來沒有過類似的事情，如果倫蒂尼姆想要更換城內的地塊的話，我們需要同步控制城牆......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別廢話了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是想乖乖聽話，還是去死？只有這兩個選擇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_408_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼回事？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我覺得他還有第三個選擇。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你——！呃——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還能站起來嗎，上尉？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_408_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......我還好。你是誰？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你曾經的戰友。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡！這裡有人混進來了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這盾？哪裡來的維多利亞士兵——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"能再次用上趁手武器的感覺，還不錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"上尉，我這個型號的炮......能毀掉城防武器的裝填系統嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_408_1","isRemote":false,"text":"做......做不到......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"和我想的差不多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"獲救士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_423_1","isRemote":false,"text":"號角，外面的薩卡茲清乾淨了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"替我再一次感謝Misery先生的幫助。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"上尉，還有沒有什麼別的方法，能關閉城防炮？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_408_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不必擺出這副沉默的表情。你早就設想過我們會來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"畢竟，你甚至沒有把曾經的城防軍士兵識別碼覆蓋乾淨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_408_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......這只是一個失誤。薩卡茲......還不會因為這個殺了我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但假如你幫了我們的話，你會被處死？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_408_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還有我的家人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_408_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們受我牽連，隨時都可能被薩卡茲處決。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我明白了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"卡爾，瞄準這位城防軍的叛徒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"獲救士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_423_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，中尉......瞄哪？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_408_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡。瞄準我的心臟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_408_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只有我死了......或許只有我死了，薩卡茲才能忘記我，不再糾纏我的家人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你真想清楚了的話，我們可以配合你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_408_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好。謝謝你，中尉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_408_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們想關閉城防炮，只有兩個方法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_408_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一個是逼迫那位薩卡茲將軍自己停下來......另一個是徹底炸毀這控制室。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"想用第一種方法的話，我們需要擊敗曼弗雷德。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_408_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的。至於第二種方法......你們的火力還不夠。而且......中尉，你做好了親手毀掉倫蒂尼姆城牆一角的準備了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道我們該怎麼做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"上尉，你自己呢......你準備好了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_408_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我等待這一刻......已經很久了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"獲救士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_423_1","isRemote":false,"text":"中尉，你沒瞄準心臟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......糟了，手滑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"把他放在升降梯上，送他下去......他的生死至少該掌握在自己手裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今天的城牆上已經夠熱鬧，不需要再多一位叛徒了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"獲救士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_423_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我們呢？要接著往上走嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走吧，我們再去見見曼弗雷德。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g4_giantwall"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哇，這升降梯的速度也太快了——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先......先別說話......我怕吐在博士身上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"畢竟我們倆剛被滑索拉著飛了幾百米......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"別再來一次了。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"習慣就好。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"都站穩了嗎？有敵人來了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡也有入侵者！立刻報告將軍！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"阿米婭，擋住攻擊！","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我們跟上那個報信的人。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可露希爾，我們需要儘快找到關閉城防炮的方法——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果這意味著必須戰勝曼弗雷德的話，那我們也需要速戰速決。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們花的時間越多，留在地下的幹員們和自救軍就越危險。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g7_subway"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳......咳咳咳。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"被一個沒怎麼見過戰場的年輕人炸成這樣......你也太狼狽了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......就算是小小的磐蟹，在被逼到絕境之時，也有夾傷人手的可能性。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"你最好賭曼弗雷德會相信。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不該出現在這裡。風險太大了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"所以你寧可獨自靠在廢墟上喘氣，也不願意讓我拉一把？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......你想扶著我的話......最好換另一邊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這條胳膊，拜她所賜，現在還動不了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"你見過她了。你的結論是什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她的確注意到那位“殿下”了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"那她......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她的想法沒有改變。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"你確定？我們都見過她那時候的樣子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"在她放著一身重傷不管，一路追殺那些刺客的時候，她的腦子裡難道不會期盼著......那位殿下還沒死嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她已經不是過去那個瘋瘋癲癲的雇傭兵了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"你是指她變得更瘋了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......誰能說得準？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"事實擺在眼前，她獨自一人偷偷摸摸地進了倫蒂尼姆，半個月來沒有折騰出任何一場爆炸，甚至連曼弗雷德都沒有發現她......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"以前的她，怕是早就衝進西部大堂，趕在被赦罪師殺死之前，在特雷西斯的王座底下埋上一百顆地雷了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我合理猜測她和那群巴別塔......不，羅德島的人一起，有了一些更聰明的打算。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"只是為了確認這一點，就差點搭上自己的命，你不覺得風險太大了一些嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"曼弗雷德的手下始終盯著我。這是唯一一個穩妥些的見面方法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"可惜了施瓦布......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"從他答應W的那一刻起，他就做好了準備。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，應該說......我們都做好了準備。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......你們最好是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"誰——？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"赦罪師......的味道！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赦罪師直屬衛兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_425_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我早就同曼弗雷德說過，你不值得信任。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赦罪師直屬衛兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_425_1","isRemote":false,"text":"赫德雷——你以為你這些自作聰明的小動作，真的都能瞞過我們的眼睛嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......這是一場誤會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赦罪師直屬衛兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_425_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦？可惜，你不會有機會再向首領和攝政王辯解了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赦罪師直屬衛兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_425_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不必再低著頭佯裝順從。拿起你的劍，享受你的最後一場戰鬥吧，雇傭兵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果......這是命令的話......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赦罪師直屬衛兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_425_1","isRemote":false,"text":"無力的攻擊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赦罪師直屬衛兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_425_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別試圖掩護你的同伴了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赦罪師直屬衛兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_425_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡的每一片陰影......都躲不開我的眼睛。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"赫德雷......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你先走！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"不，你不能下這種命令，我們已經費勁地走了這麼遠——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就更不能一起死在這裡！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赦罪師直屬衛兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_425_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不必擔心，我會在這裡一塊處決你們兩個。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赦罪師直屬衛兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_425_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們可以短暫地討論一下，誰先來——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赦罪師直屬衛兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_425_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"連一點掙扎都沒有......就倒下了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你......是你來了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":"avg_npc_395_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......他不該太自信。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":"avg_npc_395_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒人能徹底掌握陰影。看不見的地方藏著一切可能性。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳......咳咳咳......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":"avg_npc_395_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們快走吧。想活命的話，儘快回到日光下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":"avg_npc_395_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我還有其他任務在身。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":"avg_npc_395_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要知道......來到這裡的，可不止赦罪師的僕從。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g7_subway"},{"type":"narration","text":"]"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛維希婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼聲音？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救軍戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"指揮官，是後面的金屬構件砸了下來——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛維希婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不止......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......他來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛維希婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你也注意到了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"維娜，除了炮擊帶來的聲響，我沒聽見任何聲音啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......脈搏聲消失了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"跑！！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛維希婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"十二隊，徹底失去信號——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們已經全部犧牲了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛維希婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛維希婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就在剛剛，他們的聲音完全消失了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這些......漆黑的管道，原本會放大一切聲響。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"無論是人類的呼吸聲和腳步聲，磐蟹爬過管道的咔嗒聲，還是機械運作時的轟鳴——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只要有生命存在，這些管道就會記錄他們的搏動。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而此時此刻......所有聲音都被吞沒了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是說，我們身後這片黑暗——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它吞吃了一切活物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛維希婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......跟三個月前那場貴族宴會一樣的情況。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛維希婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"工程隊，關閉第一道防禦門！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救軍戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是，指揮官！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛維希婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"推進之王小姐，你......你很敏銳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛維希婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你很熟悉倫蒂尼姆的地下結構嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛維希婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我記得，費斯特說你是......本地人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......以前只進來過一次。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是關於這些管道，我聽過許多故事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛維希婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一百多年前，一場火災席捲了倫蒂尼姆的中心。只有王室和一部分貴族逃過了烈焰的捕食。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛維希婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在那之後，人們就開始傳說，王宮之下的山體裡藏著一個神奇的法陣，能讓王室成員逃過任何可怕的劫難。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛維希婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在我第一次聽說這個故事的時候，我就在想......該不會我們的王室成員也會選擇這些管道作為逃生密道吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......我聽說的故事，和你說的版本很像。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛維希婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"建造倫蒂尼姆的工人，和高高在上的王公貴族，大家會被災難逼得走同一條路——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛維希婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這本身就已經是個為人津津樂道的故事了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救軍戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"指揮官，防禦門在搖晃！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......這門擋不住他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救軍戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不會吧？這門的厚度至少能扛住裝甲載具的七八次轟擊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"後撤，我們繼續後撤！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"伴隨著一聲尖銳的巨響，金屬門中間出現了一道裂縫。\n在門後那股巨大力量的撕扯之下，厚重的金屬彷彿變得比紙還薄，那道縫正迅速地擴大，後面漆黑的空洞就像怪物幽深的口腔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛維希婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"關閉第二道防禦門！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救軍戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是......呃啊！！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"門重重地落下，但關門的人卻像是腳下打了滑。他來不及驚叫，就被什麼看不見的東西拖入了門後的陰影裡。\n一抹血紅從門下的縫隙裡滲了出來。\n但是很快，就連這攤血液都被捕獲。轉瞬之間，從門後湧出來的陰影就吞下了大半截通道。\n轟隆，又一聲巨響，分不清是來自頭頂還是身後。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"管道搖晃起來，影子邊緣變得模糊不清，就像捕食者延展的口器，試圖勾上逃亡者的腳踝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......我還聽過另一個故事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在兩百年前的一場戰爭裡，維多利亞的軍隊與其他兩個國家一起，包圍了當時那座名為卡茲戴爾的城市。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有一天晚上，一整支全副武裝的軍團在他們駐紮的山谷裡消失了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"領兵的伯爵派人去尋找他們的蹤跡，卻只看到赤色霞光映紅了整片山壁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而所有人都記得，那天......根本沒有太陽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛維希婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"第三道門——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是......最後一道門了嗎？"},{"type":"narration","text":"克洛維希婭沒有回答她。\n就像那個答案......也被填滿了管道的怪物吞吃了一樣。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
